# Jolly VN Chapter 2 - Lake Morning (cotton-candy branch)
[chapter name="Chapter 2 - Lake Morning"]
[bg file="images/bg/lake.png" time="0.5"]
[ch left="images/ch/jolly.png" time="0.5" fade="normal"]
[text text="Next morning. Wooden dock on a mountain lake. Mist, church bells, sparkling sun."]
[text name="Jolly" text="The cotton candy melted a little overnight. Now it is a tiny pink cloud hat. I regret nothing."]
[text name="Jolly" text="Should I skip a stone across the lake, or sit and watch the mist lift?"]
[choose name="lake" text1="Skip a flat stone" value1="skip" text2="Sit and watch the mist" value2="sit"]
[if lhs="${lake}" op="==" rhs="skip"]
[goto name="skip"]
[endif]
[goto name="sit"]
[label name="skip"]
[text name="Jolly" text="One, two, three, four skips! The orb counted. The orb is a very serious judge."]
[text text="Ripples cross the whole lake, turning the morning sun into a thousand tiny festivals."]
[goto name="fin"]
[label name="sit"]
[text name="Jolly" text="If I sit very still, the mist sits with me. Today we are both clouds."]
[text text="Slowly the mist lifts. The village across the lake appears, house by house."]
[label name="fin"]
[bg file="images/bg/ramen.png" time="0.5"]
[text name="Jolly" text="Chapter 2 complete - cotton-candy branch. All that sparkling worked up an appetite. The End. Try the other treat!"]
[ch left="none" time="0.5"]
